  "translation": "Yessawel Asa ɣer Yahwe Elohim-is, yenna: Yahwe, ulac wayeḍ mačči d kečç i yeɛawen, gar win yesɛan tazmert d win ur nesɛi ara tazmert. Ɛawen-aɣ, a Yahwe Elohim-nneɣ, axaṭer ɣef kečč i neṭṭef, s yisem-ik i d-nusa ɣer lḥecd-agi. Kečç i d Yahwe Elohim-nneɣ; ad yeqqim ulac wemdan ur k-iqelleɛ ara.",
